    <li><a href="https://github.com/Symontoclay/SymOntoClay/blob/master/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md">Contributor Code of Conduct</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://discord.gg/UkC5r3ZDTN">Discord Community</a></li>
  </ul>
